<!DOCTYPE suite SYSTEM "https://testng.org/testng-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Full regression suite — API + UI.

  Run:
    mvn test -Denv=dev -Dsuite=regression

  Ordering notes:
    - parallel="none" — tests run sequentially in document order.
    - ResourceDeactivationTest (TC-RES-015 alerts) runs before Inventory API/UI
      so alert teardown does not affect залишки tests on the same storage.
    - StorageRegionTest → Owner2ScopePreflightTest → StorageVisibilityTest → RelocationVisibility*
      (shared owner2 storage; preflight FAILS if OWNER_2 JWT has extra BUs).
    - DB-seeded cases (TC-DEF-030, TC-FAITA-IMPL-002, TC-FLY-WO-001, TC-RVW-BOM-034) run when
      use.database=true (staging default) and JDBC is reachable; otherwise they SkipException.
      Isolated suite: mvn test -Dsuite=db-dependent -Denv=…
    - Includes domain suites: smoke, functional subsets, inventory, production,
      relocations, storage-regions, global-plans, technological-maps, defects,
      resource-viewer, ui, orders, bots, notifications, RBAC matrix.
      Hierarchy inventory (TC-WMS-007-010+) is in Inventory API/UI.
      TC-CREW-FIGHT-* skip when Fight write-off probe fails (GET short-stats ≠ 200).
-->
